# Network interfaces. eth0 (net0 in Proxmox) is the WAN.
# IFACE [addr=proxmox|none|IP/PREFIX] [addr6=...] [dhcp=START-END] [type=vlan|bridge ...]
# What may pass is set in the rules file. On the first start pxmxfw rewrites
# this from the NICs Proxmox created; NICs added later are added here, and
# nothing passes through them until rules name them.
eth0
eth1
